WEBVTT

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:02.540
The Digital World.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:06.990
Taiki Kudou, the boy of destiny, 
was taken to this mysterious world.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.590
There he met the Digimon, 
and bonds formed between them.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.830
His epic adventure with 
the Digimon to bring

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.360
peace back to their 
world is about to begin.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.860
DigiXros!

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.050
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.300
When I tried to save someone

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.980
who sounded like he was 
on the verge of death,

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.740
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.520
<b>Our current location</b>

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.520
<b>Green Zone</b>

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:56.130
I met Shoutmon and lots 
of other monsters there.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.820
Apparently, they're called Digimon.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:08.870
<b>Shoutmon Roars!</b>

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.670
Shoutmon Roars!

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.260
Almost there, Taiki!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:14.630
Hey, where are you taking me?

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.610
There's something I want to show you!

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.450
Come on!

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.820
He's fast...

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.250
Here we are!

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.980
Take a look, Taiki.

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:33.260
That's our home, the Village of Smiles.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.190
And spreading out beyond 
that is the Green Zone.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.370
Pretty amazing, isn't it?

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:44.740
Wait... What's a Green Zone?

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.780
A-A Zone is... well...

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.550
Ahem.

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:53.920
Zones are like countries 
in the Digital World.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.960
Oh, great timing, old man!

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.800
You will call me Master Jijimon!

00:02:58.800 --> 00:02:59.520
Right...

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:07.490
Thank you for saving Shoutmon's 
life and our village.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.180
Oh, it was nothing... 
I just couldn't turn my back on him.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:13.370
It's become difficult for us to 
live in this village recently.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.310
Did something happen?

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:19.720
War has broken out in the Digital World,

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.380
making its way through all the Zones.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.630
Even our Green Zone has been

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.610
invaded by the evil Bagra Empire's army.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:30.190
Its end is drawing nigh.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.640
That sounds terrible...

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.290
But everything's okay now!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:42.130
Everyone, Taiki here is gonna 
fight with us as our General!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.340
What's happening?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.010
Our village...

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.150
That's one of MadLeomon's followers!

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:58.580
So the remnants of that army were 
still prowling around here?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.550
They won't get away with this!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.810
Let's go, General!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.460
Taiki!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:14.490
Jeez! Why did you have to get dragged 
into this crazy Digital World?!

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:16.670
And tomorrow is Marine Day!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.970
Listen to the shout of my soul!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.420
Rowdy Rocker!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:34.750
Let's go!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.590
Prepare yourself!

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.720
One more time!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.880
This time I— Huh?

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.700
Where is he?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.740
What kind of battle strategy is that?

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.040
I can't turn my back on him!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.790
To attack a flying enemy, we need...

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.550
This!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.630
Pickmons!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.090
DigiXros!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.600
Pickmons!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.630
DigiXros!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.330
A Digimon Slingshot?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.170
That's my General!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.300
Target: the enemy Digimon!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.140
Now!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.480
Coming straight at you this time!

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:30.400
Rowdy Rocker!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.720
Yahoo!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.440
As long as I've got you,

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.540
I'm sure to become the Digimon King!

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.970
I've had enough of this place.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:57.770
You can say that again.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:00.270
We'll never make it back 
for Marine Day tomorrow.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.520
And I was looking forward to that

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.390
deal for two squid ink 
pastas at half price...

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.940
Hey, we're in a town, right?

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.480
Then maybe...

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:14.950
Out of Range

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.510
Out of range...

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.420
I wonder if we'll ever get home...

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.760
Mom and Dad must be worried about me...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:26.610
I hate tears.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.030
I'm not crying!

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.370
Wait... Who are you?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.600
Me? I'm...

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.140
Cutemon!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.480
Cutemon?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.280
Yep, Cutemon!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.480
Come on, cheer up!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.580
Thanks.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.330
Cutemon!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.690
Target of investigation found.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.560
Immediate elimination is possible.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.390
Dorulumon!

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:02.640
Hey there, Cutemon. 
I've been looking for you.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.360
Oh, a human?

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.430
It's okay.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.040
Dorulumon is a friend.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.380
Thanks for looking after him.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.510
Huh?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:19.650
Who are you?

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.680
Just a passerby.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.090
Bye bye!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.930
What's going on?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.910
Did you see me in action, Akari?

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.790
Don't give me that!

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.310
You just have to run off 
on your own all the time!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.900
And in a place like this...

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.400
What will you do if we 
can't get back home?!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.180
Now, now, you two.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:47.910
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:50.480
<i>If Taiki starts talking 
about going home now,</i>

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.980
<i>I'll never become the Digimon King.</i>

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.280
<i>I've gotta figure out some way to stop him!</i>

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.550
What's wrong, Shoutmon?

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:02.560
Well, now that you're in 
the Village of Smiles...

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:06.460
We're gonna throw you a welcome party!

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:08.970
Greymon!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.300
MailBirdramon!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.540
DigiXros!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.720
First platoon destroyed.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.570
Second platoon destroyed.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.750
That blue pest!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.450
Blasted humans!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.660
Barging into the Digital 
World one after another...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.900
Annihilation complete.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.540
Blue is strong.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.520
Dondokomon!

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:10.000
Everything tastes the same.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.420
They're throwing us a welcome party! 
Show some gratitude!

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.700
Yeah, but...

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.160
What do you think?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.910
Great food and the hottest babe around!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:31.220
The Digital World is a much nicer 
place than your human world, right?

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.490
You can stop trying so hard, Shoutmon.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:34.150
Huh?

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:38.050
We'll be leaving this 
village in the morning.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:39.620
What?!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:43.160
Wh-What do you mean, leaving?

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.990
I've gotten two of my 
friends mixed up in this.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:50.670
That's why we have to go 
back to the human world.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.600
<i>Crap!</i>

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.800
<i>If Taiki goes back to the human world,</i>

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.310
<i>I can't become the Digimon King!</i>

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.580
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.580
Are you okay, Shoutmon?

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.720
Listen to me, Taiki!

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.570
The Digimon World is 
all the rage right now!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.290
I've heard there are other humans here,

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.000
besides you guys, fighting in this war!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:14.840
Huh?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.870
And they can use the DigiXros, too!

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.580
They're the strongest around!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.480
Which means this world 
is way more interesting

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.580
than your human world!

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:28.480
So maybe, if we can find those humans...

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.480
They might know a way to get 
back to the human world!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.440
What?!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.290
All right, let's go see them!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:40.800
Please, Taiki! Reconsider!

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.890
Do you really have to 
follow me here, too?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:48.260
Can you really turn your back 
on a troubled soul like me?

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.260
Are you really in that much trouble?

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.590
Yes, I am.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:57.500
And you can't turn your back on 
someone who's in trouble, right?

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.870
No, I can't!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.160
That's it.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.940
That's my Taiki!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.610
No, Taiki!

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.880
Why are you here, too?!

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:10.500
You have a bad habit of letting 
sympathy take over your senses.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.380
Shut up!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.850
Outsiders should stay out of this!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.170
Who are you calling an outsider?!

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.050
Please, Taiki!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.320
I'm begging you!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.990
You're the only one who can 
make me the Digimon King!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.320
Please!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.660
Become King? Is that all you want?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.880
What do you mean, "Is that all?"

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.810
That's your own dream.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.530
You should make that happen on your own.

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.380
Here.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.880
Don't forget to wipe off your hands.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.250
Oh, thanks.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.950
Without you...

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.440
I... We...

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.820
We'll all be crushed again!

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.760
You jerk!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.320
Shoutmon...

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.450
What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.090
We're humans! We're not like you guys!

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.450
We're weak! We're fragile!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.270
Shut up!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.820
Stupid Taiki!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.790
You're the stupid one!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.550
He...

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.520
Huh?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.070
He was crying...

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.220
Orochi!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.540
Forward!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.090
We'll massacre those humans!

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.030
Don't ever come back!

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:09.070
Just go wherever and drop dead!

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:12.470
Taiki, what are you doing? Let's go.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.340
Yeah.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:17.780
I can't see them anymore.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:18.640
What?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.080
Did they come back?

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.150
No! Look beyond the forest!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.580
What? Isn't that MadLeomon's army?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.320
What should we do?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.190
They're headed straight 
for Taiki and the others!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:37.610
What did you say?!

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.660
You're hurting me, Brother...

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.500
<i>That's your own dream.</i>

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.240
<i>You should make that happen on your own.</i>

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.440
He made his own choice to leave!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.210
Brother...

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.630
Everyone, MadLeomon's army is coming!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.380
Fortify the village defenses!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.600
Taiki, what are you so down about?

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.320
Let's hurry up and find

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.890
those other humans who are in this world.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:10.170
That's right. We have to get 
back to our world soon.

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:10.760
What was that?

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.740
What are those things?

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:21.910
Are we surrounded?

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.420
What luck.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:27.250
I get to take care of the humans 
before invading the village.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.560
How?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.490
How can weak little humans like you

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.140
be a threat to my army?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:34.720
How?!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.990
This is how!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.590
Run!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:43.350
Blasted humans!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.130
Release Orochimon!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.400
Tear those humans limb from limb!

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.850
Orochi!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:04.630
Over here, Akari!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.650
Thanks!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.760
Why do you have to hide here, too?!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.890
Because it's safe here!

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.260
Not so safe, after all!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.830
I'll say!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.250
What is that huge thing?

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.560
How should I know?!

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.590
Just keep running!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.170
Run? But... Look up ahead!

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.560
A dead end!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.800
Pedal to the metal!

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:29.940
Got it!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.510
You want us to use our 
momentum to climb it?!

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.600
Almost... there...

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.920
Orochi!

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.560
Orochi!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:43.960
Taiki...

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:44.990
What's your next plan?

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.350
Orochi!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.550
Grit your teeth!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.300
Little fools.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.070
What's going on?

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.130
We're saved...

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.210
Y-You!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.040
Shoutmon!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.280
He came to save us 
after he was so angry?

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.710
Shut up!

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:18.420
I just couldn't turn my back 
on you guys, that's all!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.190
Sounds good.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.790
Doesn't it?

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.230
Shoutmon!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.660
No time to waste! Climb up!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.110
Okay! Thanks!

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.670
Go! Hurry!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.040
Horn Breaker!

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:39.340
All right!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:43.430
Rowdy Rocker!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.520
Ouch!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.540
Impudent fools!

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.150
I'll finish this myself!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:54.660
What's happening?

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:01.630
What?

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.610
He absorbed Orochimon!

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:13.460
Behold my power!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:19.590
Crap...

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:23.680
They're done for!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.090
No, not yet!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.530
Nice one, Ballistamon!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:35.310
I won't let you mess up 
our village anymore!

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.340
<i>How naïve.</i>

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:41.110
<i>One is all power and no speed.</i>

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:45.340
<i>One has speed, but no strategical sense.</i>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.930
No! If you try to hit him now...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.870
Shoutmon!

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.850
Oh, it's over! They're done for!

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:58.960
Shoutmon...

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.760
If I'm defeated now...

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.950
I'll never become the Digimon King.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.870
And if I don't become 
the Digimon King...

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.500
I can't protect everyone in the village!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:12.700
Shoutmon...

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:17.620
Becoming the Digimon King 
wasn't just your own dream?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:20.240
You...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.450
This is the end!

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.920
Begone!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.770
Until I become the Digimon King...

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.080
I can't lose!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:34.760
Yeah!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.360
Honestly, I just...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:38.960
...can't turn my back on you!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:41.500
Shoutmon!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.350
Ballistamon!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.440
DigiXros!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.590
You're finished.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.620
DigiXros?! Is that...

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:07.230
Wanna know?

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.690
Then I'll tell you!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.220
It's Shoutmon X2!

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.500
Man, this feels great!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.440
Go, Shoutmon X2!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:25.960
All right!

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.310
What incredible power!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.950
Curse you!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:32.780
That's nothing!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.600
And not just power!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.220
His speed is amazing, too!

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:38.160
Arm Bunker!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:43.700
Do you think you two can win just 
by combining your strength?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.100
You don't understand, do you?

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:48.700
What?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.700
Our true power!

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:54.740
A feint?!

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:00.110
Covering for each other's weaknesses

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.150
gives them infinite power!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.290
That's the true power of the DigiXros!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.760
Buddy Blaster!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.730
All right!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.540
We did it!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:30.380
How?

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.650
How can runts like them 
have so much power?

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:37.980
Is this all because of the humans 
who came to the Digital World?

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:41.720
Withdraw!

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:52.930
The red one is getting interesting.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.710
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Monitamon's Lovely♥ Enemy Search</b>

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.070
Searching for enemy data.

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.490
Ballistamon.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.920
Attacks include Horn Breaker,

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:11.780
<b>[Type]

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:11.780
<b>Machine Type</b>

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:11.780
<b>
Horn Breaker 

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.530
in which he uses his large 
horn to toss opponents high.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.470
He can also flip pancakes with it.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.890
Rather handy.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.350
I bet it would work on kebabs, too.

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:12.050
Yeah!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.120
Oh, please...

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.060
Work for me, Taiki Kudou.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.920
Do that and I'll help you.

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:22.560
Is that a blue Xros Loader?

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.180
You're a General, too?

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:25.900
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:29.550
<b>The Rival, Kiriha, Appears!</b>

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.950
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
